  "mn100:42.2": "aṭṭhitavataṁ → aṭṭhitavata (sya-all, km, pts1ed) | sappurisavataṁ → sappurisavata (sya-all, km, pts1ed) ",
  "mn100:42.3": "",
  "mn100:42.4": "atthi devā”ti → adhidevāti (mr) ",
  "mn100:42.5": "Ṭhānaso metaṁ → ṭhānaso kho panetaṁ (sya-all, km); kho panetaṁ (mr) ",
  "mn100:42.6": "adhidevā”ti → atthi devāti (bj, sya-all, km, pts1ed); atidevāti (?) ",
  "mn100:42.7": "",
  "mn100:42.8": "",
  "mn100:42.9": "puṭṭho samāno ‘atthi devā’ti yo vadeyya, ‘ṭhānaso me viditā’ti → ṭhānaso viditā me viditāti (sya-all, km, pts1ed); ṭhānaso me viditā atidevāti (?) ",
  "mn100:42.10": "gantabbaṁ → gantuṁ vā (sya-all, km); gantuṁ (mr) ",
  "mn100:42.11": "",
  "mn100:42.12": "gotamo ādikeneva na byākāsī”ti → gotamo ādikeneva byākāsīti (mr); gotamo atthi devāti na byākāsīti (?) ",
